<!--
  IELTS Learning Platform — System Architecture
  Layout: Strict Top-to-Bottom, 6 horizontal layers, no overlapping
  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  Layer 0  y=10–110      CLIENT TIER                           │
  │  Layer 1  y=140–250     API GATEWAY + REDIS                   │
  │  Layer 2  y=280–390     CORE SERVICES (6 boxes)               │
  │  Layer 3  y=430–540     SKILL SERVICES (4) + EXAM (1)         │
  │  Layer 4  y=580–690     AI SERVICE + RABBITMQ + GEMINI        │
  │  Layer 5  y=730–850     DATA LAYER (10 MongoDB DBs)           │
  │  Legend   y=10–360      x=1680 (outside main flow)            │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  Canvas: 1900 x 1200
-->
